[CHANGE] benchmark_2/parts/semver_solver/lib/semver_solver_impl.py: Eliminated the cited unreachable caret-wildcard fallback by restructuring rather than annotating: _caret_wildcard_upper now takes the caller-narrowed major component as a required int plus the remaining components, returns a non-optional Version, and no longer contains the dead 'major is None' branch; the caller passes components[0] (already proven non-None by its root-wildcard early return) and the now-unneeded optional caret-None check was removed too. Caret/tilde wildcard ceilings (^1.x, ^0.x, ^0.2.x, ^0.0.x, ^1.2.x, ~1.x, ~1.2.x, ^*) plus range validation, precedence, and resolver behavior are unchanged and regression-verified; the tool-generated lifecycle block was left untouched.
